    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const hnComments = $('HN Search').all().map(item => \n  item.json.hits?.map(h => h.comment_text || h.title || '').join(' ') || ''\n).join(' ').slice(0, 2000);\n\nconst hnStories = $('HN Stories').all().map(item =>\n  item.json.hits?.map(h => h.title || '').join(' ') || ''\n).join(' ').slice(0, 1000);\n\nconst githubIssues = $('Github issues').all().map(item =>\n  item.json.items?.map(i => i.title + ': ' + (i.body || '')).join(' ') || ''\n).join(' ').slice(0, 1000);\n\nconst competitor = $('On form submission').first().json['Competitor Name'];\nconst yourProduct = $('On form submission').first().json['Your Product'];\n\nconst prompt = `You are a senior Product Manager at ${yourProduct}.\n\nAnalyze this real user data about ${competitor} and produce a strategic PM brief for ${yourProduct}.\n\nHN Discussions: ${hnComments}\nHN Stories: ${hnStories}\nGitHub Issues: ${githubIssues}\n\nProduce the following:\n\n1. HOW USERS PERCEIVE ${competitor}\n- Strengths users mention\n- Complaints and pain points\n- Gaps in their product\n\n2. TOP 3 MARKET GAPS NOBODY IS SOLVING\n- Be specific, not generic\n\n3. WHAT ${yourProduct} SHOULD BUILD IN THE NEXT 90 DAYS\n- Priority 1 (Days 1-30)\n- Priority 2 (Days 30-60)\n- Priority 3 (Days 60-90)\n\n4. MOST UNDERSERVED CUSTOMER SEGMENT\n- Who they are\n- Why nobody is serving them\n- What ${yourProduct} should offer them\n\nBe specific. No fluff. Every recommendation must reference actual signals from the data.`;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    competitor,\n    yourProduct,\n    prompt\n  }\n}];"
      },
